  "description": "CR 702.103e a bestowed copy whose host died resolves as a token creature",
  "note": "Lithoform Engine copies the bestowed Nyxborn Rollicker spell; a Bolt then kills its host, the War Mammoth, so as the copy begins resolving it ceases to be bestowed and resolves as a creature spell: a token creature, attached to nothing (CR 702.103e). It is a creature again, so it keeps Satyr. The original then resolves as a creature card beside it (CR 608.3b), and the Goblin Piker bystander was never enchanted. The one Rollicker card is still on the stack when the copy resolves, so the Rollicker on the battlefield then (Nyxborn Rollicker#2) can only be the token copy.",
